WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Hi! Welcome to Jowb yaaba Academy. Choose Seydina for fifth grade, or Cheikh for rising seventh grade.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.236
Pick a subject quest and open its card to see the mission, time, and task.

00:00:13.736 --> 00:00:19.437
Read the mission first, then read the task, so you know what finished work looks like.

00:00:19.936 --> 00:00:27.157
Press the browser narration play button, pause or stop it, and open the transcript when you want the words on screen.

00:00:27.657 --> 00:00:32.789
Use Watch or Learn for an optional outside lesson; the link needs internet.

00:00:33.289 --> 00:00:40.220
Try the real multiple-choice and true-or-false questions, and match terms when that activity appears.

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:45.538
Check your answers for feedback; retry when the app offers another attempt.

00:00:46.038 --> 00:00:51.646
Mark the quest done when your work and quiz are ready to earn XP and grow your streak.

00:00:52.146 --> 00:00:58.636
Open the progress sheet to see completion bars, scores, XP, streaks, and awards.

00:00:59.136 --> 00:01:06.334
Download a progress report, and ask an adult before using Reset Progress because it clears results.

00:01:06.834 --> 00:01:12.674
Focus Mode is a twenty-minute sprint; press Start, then Reset when you need a fresh timer.

00:01:13.174 --> 00:01:19.083
Weekly Homework has all 36 school-year weeks; choose a week and filter by subject.

00:01:19.583 --> 00:01:27.269
Open a day, use its learning link if you like, complete its quick check, retry when allowed, and mark the day done.

00:01:27.769 --> 00:01:34.596
Print This Week’s Worksheet opens a student sheet for pencil-and-paper work or saving as a PDF.

00:01:35.096 --> 00:01:42.480
Answer keys and answer-inclusive printing are for parents and educators, protected by the parent PIN check.

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:51.920
Parent Dashboard lets adults see both profiles, XP, quests, streaks, quiz averages, awards, and weekly activity.

00:01:52.420 --> 00:02:01.824
Leaderboard shows overall standings, this week’s XP, weekly days, and quiz averages; it is a progress view, not a judgement.

00:02:02.324 --> 00:02:11.937
After pages load, saved lessons, quizzes, progress, worksheets, and the timer remain useful offline; outside links need internet.

00:02:12.437 --> 00:02:19.345
To install, use your browser menu and choose Add to Home Screen or Install; the words vary by browser.

00:02:19.845 --> 00:02:25.209
Reopen the guide with How to use this app, then choose a chapter and keep exploring.
